    "text": "Taft Midway Driller\nwebsite\nTaft\nTaft golfers finish second in SSL shoot-out, drop friendly to Shafter\nBy Mike Blake,\n7 hours agoThe Wildcats came up short during a close South Sequoia League shoot-out – SSL No. 5 -- on Tuesday, September 23, at North Kern Golf Course. Taft Union High School golf coach Mike Cowan said, “We played well at the end, but finished in second place to the Shafter Generals by a measly seven strokes.”",
